<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">Daniel</book>
  <para style="h">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="mt">Daniel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoiakim ii Judah kumpi a sua zawk a kum thum kumin, Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Jerusalem khuapi simin uumci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in, Jehoiakim Kumpipa sia Nebuchadnezzar Kumpipa in mansak a, biakinn na manpha pawlkhatte laaksak hi. Ama in a mat mihing pawlkhatte Babylon khua ama ii pathiante biakinn ah ciapui a, a mat sum le vanh manphate biakinn vanh kholna inndoite sungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa in Israel saltaangte sung pan kumpi nam le nampite tangvalno pawlkhat teal tu in a khutnuai ulianbel Ashpenaz thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua a teal mihingte sia kumpi inn sungah naseam thiamte a sua thei natu in a mealhoi, a pilvang, pha tak nasep a kisinsak sa, thu a he pal le pumpi tung paubanna nei ngawlte hi tu hi. Amate sia Babylon kam taw lai a sim thei natu le a at thei natu in Ashpenaz in hil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpi inn sungah a om mihingte bangma in amate sia ni simin an le sapittui a piak natu kumpipa in thupia si hi. Hi bangin kum thum a sin zawkciang kumpipa mai ah kilak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabang a kitealte sung panin Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, le Azariah kihel a, a vekpi in Judah nam ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ulianbel pa in amate sia min thak phua in: Belteshazzar, Shadrach, Meshach le Abednego ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Daniel in kumpi inn sung pan a kipia an le sapittui neakna taw in ama le ama biakna sangah a kininsak ngawl natu in a thin khensat ahikom ama in Ashpenaz tungah huna ngen hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuaciang Pathian in Ashpenaz sia Daniel tungah hesuakna thin neisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahizong Ashpenaz in kumpipa kiita ahikom ama in Daniel tungah, “Kumpipa in na neak tu le na dawn tu see sa nei zo ahikom, tangvalno dangte bangza ban zo bua lete ama in kei hong thatlum tu hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Daniel sia ama le a lawm thum teng a uk in Ashpenaz ii a koi a cingpa kungah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in, “Ni sawm sung hong sin ta'n a, ka neak tu uh anteete le ka dawn tu tui hong pia ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpi an a ne tangvalno dangte taw hong ettee khawm ta'n a, ka meal uh nong muna bangin thu hong khen ta'n” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ashpenaz in ni sawm sung kisinsak tu in thukim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hun a cin ciang amate sia kumpi an a nete theampo sangin a ciidam tuak zaw, a tha hat tuak zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua ni pan kipan amate a cing pa in kumpipa ii piak an luangin anteete ne suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian in tua tangvalno lite sia heak theina, lai thiam pilna le thuthuk ngaisut theinate pia hi. Tua bek dom ngawlin ama in Daniel sia mukholnate pheen theina le mang khiak thiamna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa ii ciangtan kum thum a cin ciang, Ashpenaz in tangvalnote theampo sia Nebuchadnezzar kungah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa in amate paupui siat a, Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael le Azariah sia a dangte sangin lungkimhuai sa zaw hi. Tua ahikom amate sia kumpipa inn sungah a vaihawm pawlmi suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpipa in a dok pawpo ahibuale bangbang thu haksa nawno dongh kale hi mihing lite in a kumpi ngam bup a om aisaan theite le mitbum thiamte khat pawpo sangin a sawmvei in he zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daniel sia kumpi inn ah Persia kumpilianpa Cyrus ii Babylon zo in a uk dong om suak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in kumpi a sua zawk a kum nii kumin mang khat man hi. Tua mang in ama thinngimsak mama a, mu thei ngawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua ahikom ama tungah a mang khiakna son tu in a aisaan theite, mitbum thiamte, bum toaite le ai toaite samsak hi. Amate hong pai in kumpipa mai ah a din uh ciang kumpipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate tungah, “Mang khat ka mat huvau in ka thinngim hi. Tua ka mang ii a khiakna he nuam khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Aramaic kam taw kumpipa tungah, “Kumpipa awng na khansau tawntung tahen! Na mang hong son ta'n, tua hile a khiakna kong sonthiang tu uh hi” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa in amate tungah, “Ka mang nong son kul tu a, tua zawkciang a khiakna nong son nanak natu uh in ka thin khensat zo khi hi. Nong son thei bua uh le, na khut le na peangte kong semthapsak tu a, na inn uh sia niinthuk ka suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizong ka mang le a khiakna nong son thei uh le letsong le min phatna lian kong pia tu hi. Tua ahiciang tu in, ka mang sia bang hi a, a khiakna bang ziam cisia hong son tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in kumpipa tungah, “Kumpipa awng na mang hong son phot po lete, a khiakna kong sonthiang tu uh hi” ci kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang, kumpipa a nging in au a, “Ka ngaisut sa bangma hi nu hi! Hun haisaang thethei natu hanciam nu hi, banghang ziam cile ka mang nong son bua uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />na vekpi a kibangin daan pia tu ci a ka khensat sia na heak uh hang ahi hi. Kei tungah leilot thu nong sawson uh sia na lungkim tek uh ma ahi hi, banghang ziam cile hun hong kilaih tu hi ci in na lamet uh hang ahi hi. Ka mang sia bang ziam hong son tavun, tua hile a khiakna zongh hong son thei si tu ci in ka he tu hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa ii thudokte in, “Kumpipa awng, na heak nop bang sia hong son thei tu, hi leitung ah mihing khat beak om ngawl hi. Kumpipa dom ngawlin, milianbel le a vaanglianbel ngawngawn zongh khat beak in a aisaan theite, mitbum thiamte le bumtoai aitoaite tungah tuabang thute a dongh ngei kuama om ngawl lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa ii nong thu dokna sia haksa mama ahikom pathiante simngawl hong son thei tu kuama om ngawl hi, tuaciang amate sia mihingte sungah teang ngawl hi” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, kumpipa thin uuk mama a, Babylon ngamsung kumpi ii thudokte theampo thalup tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate theampo thalup siat tu in thu kipia a, tuate sungah Daniel le a lawmte zongh kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Daniel sia mihing that tu a kisawl, kumpipa cingte a uk mangpa Arioch kungah pai hi. Kampau kidawm kawmin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ama in banghangin kumpipa in tuabang thupiak nasia mama khat suaksak ziam ci in, Arioch tungah dongh hi. Tuasia ciang Arioch in Daniel tungah thupiang teng son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thakhat thu in Daniel pai a, kumpipa ii mang a khiak thei natu in kumpipa tung pan a hun nga thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Daniel sia inn ah cia a, thupiang teng a lawmte Hananiah, Mishael le Azariah tungah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vantung Pathian in amate hesuak a, tua thu tumdang sia sonthiang thei in, Babylon ngamsung a kumpi thudok dangte taw a kithalup khop ngawl natu in, ama in a lawmte thungen tu in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuasia ciang tua zanin tua thu tumdang sia Daniel mukholna sungah kipualaak hi, tuaciang ama in vantung Pathian a pok hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Pathian sia ciim in vaanglian hi! Ama a tawntung a tawntungin pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in hunte le khua hunte uk hi; ama in kumpite panmun pia a, kumpite phiat hi; ciimna le pilna a pia pa sia ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in thuthukte le thukute pualaak hi; ama in khuazing sungah a kiphualte he a, ama mama sia khuavak in uumci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka taanghpupite ii Pathian awng, nang kong pok a, kong zakta hi. Nangma in ciimna le thahatna nong pia zo hi; Ka thungetna nong zo a, kumpipa tungah ka son tu thute nong lak zo hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Daniel sia kumpipa ii thudokte that tu in a sawl pa Arioch kungah pai hi. Daniel in Arioch tungah “Kumpipa ii thudokte that heak in. Kumpipa kungah hong paipui ta'n, a mang khiakna ka son tu hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thakhatin Arioch in Daniel sia Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa omna ah paipui in kumpipa tungah, “Kumpipa awng, Judah saltaangte sung panin na mang khiakna hong son thei tu khat mu zo khi hi” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa in (Belteshazzar zongh a kici) Daniel tungah, “Ka mangmat sia le a khiakna nong son thei tu ziam” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Daniel in, “Kumpipa awng, tuasia hong son thei tu in, bum lei aitoai, mitbum thiam, aisaan thiam ahibuale aksi en thiam kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahihang thutumdangte a pualaak vantung ah Pathian khat om hi. Ama in maisang thupiang tute, Nangma Kumpipa tungah hong hil zo hi. Na mut laitak a na mu kholna, tua mang sia tu in kong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, na mut laitakin, maisang hong piang tute mang in na man hi; thutumdangte a pualaak Pathian in a piang tu thu hong lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu in midangte saangin ka pil zawk man hi ngawl hi, ahizong Nangma kumpipa ii na mang khiakna le na ngaisut thute na heak natu in hi thu tumdang sia kei tungah hong kipualaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, na mukholna sungah a taang hemhom a kiitakhuai milim lian mama khat na mai ah a ding na mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua milim lutang sia khamh ciitak taw kivawt a; a awm le a baante sia ngunn taw kivawt in; a kawng le a khealte sia taau taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A peangte thik taw kivawt a, a peangpakte khen khat thik taw kivawt in, khen khat tungman taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua milim na et laitak, kuama ii thuthaak ngawl bulin, liang tung pan suangtum lian khat hong liiksuk a, thik le tungman taw a kivawt milim ii peangte kha in zaanthamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thakhatin thik, tungman, taau, ngunn le khamhte tamhneen ngawp a, khuakhaal lai ancilna mun a leivuite taw kibang hi. Vui in tuate seammang a, bangma taang nawn ngawl hi. Ahizong tua suangtum sia khang in mual cia pha a, leitung buppi huam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Na mangmat sia tu a bang teng hi. Tu in Nangma Kumpipa tungah a khiakna kong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kumpipa awng, nangma in kumpi theampo sung panin a lianbel na hi hi. Vantung Pathian in nang sia kumpi lian in hong koi zo a, vaangletna, thahatna le upatna hong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama in nang sia mihing teenna leitung theampo, nganhingte le vacimte theampo a ukpa in hong koi zo hi. Tua khamh lutang sia nangma na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nang zawkciang nangma ngam za in a lian ngawl kumpi ngamlian khat hong piang tu a, tua zawkciang leitung buppi a uk tu taau ahi kumpi ngamlian thumna piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua zawkciang na theampo sutham in a zaansak, thik bangin a kho, kumpi ngamlian lina hong piang tu hi. Thik in na theampo a sukthap bangin tua a ngam in kumpi ngamlian masa teng khen tham in sucip tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A peangpak le a peangmete khen khat sia thik hi a, khen khat tungman a hina zongh na mu hi. Tuasia in a kikhen ngamlian khat hi tu hi, a cina hi. Tungman le thik kingawm ahikom tua in thik ii thahatna a khomkhat nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Peangmete — khen khat thik, khen khat tungman — a hina sia kumpi ngamlian khen khat thahat in khen khat thazawm tu, cinopna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thik le tungman a kihel khawm zongh na mu hi. Tua kumpi ngamlian ukte in a innkuanpuite kiteensakna taw in ngawmtua tu hanciam tu a, ahihang thik le tungman a kihel thei ngawl bangma in kingawmtua thei ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ngamukte hun sungin, vantung Pathian in a bo ngeingawl tu kumpi ngam khat phut tu hi. Tua ngam sia kuama in zo zo ngawl tu a, ahizong tua ngam in kumpi ngamliante theampo zo ngawpin kip tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kuama ii thuthaak ngawl bulin liang tung pan hong liik suangtum khat in thik, taau, tungman, ngunn le khamh taw a kivawt milim sia a denthap na mu hi. A lian Pathian in mai sangah a piang tu thu, Nangma Kumpipa tungah hong son hi. Na mangmat sia ahi bang vateak in kong son zo a, a khiakna maan kong son zo hi” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuaciang Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa lei ah kunsuk in, sangaw biakpiaknate le biakpiaknate Daniel tungah vawt tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Na Pathian sia pathian theampo sung pan a lianbel, kumpite tungah Topa hi a, thu telhakte a pualaak pa ahi hi. Hi thu ka he hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in hi thu telhak sia na pualaak thei hang hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa in Daniel sia letsong pha tam ma pia in a za khangsak a, Babylon ngamkhen uksakin, kumpi thudokte theampo ii lutang in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Daniel ii ngetna bangma in kumpipa in Shadrach, Meshach le Abednego te sia Babylon ngamkhen sung vaite a uk tu in koi a, Daniel ahile kumpi inn sungah om suak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in metre 27 a saang le metre 3 dektak a lian khamh milim khat vawt a, Babylon ngamkhen Dura zaangtam ah phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa in a ulian theampo — kumpinote, ngamkhen ukte, ngamkhen uk domte, menzite, sumkeamte, thukhenmangte le ngamkhente ii ulian dangte theampo a kikhop tek natu in thupia hi. Amate sia Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar ii milim aapna poai siim tek tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi uliante theampo milim aapna vawt tu in kikhawmtua a, milim mai ah a din uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thu puak khat in aw nging takin au a, “Ngam theampo, minam theampo le paunam theampo pan mihingte awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lemle aw na za tu uh a, tua zomin tum thei oboe te, liamlo te, zither te le tengtonghte; tuaciang a dang tum thei theampo in hunghuan tu hi. Tum thei teng hong kitum po ciang, Nebuchadnezzar ii phu sa khamh milim mai ah kunin na bia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kun in a bia ngawl peuma sia thakhat thu in a lingh meiphual sung denna kinei tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuabangin, ngam theampo, minam theampo le paunam theampo pan mihingte in tum theite awte a zaak pawpo uh ciang, kunin Nebuchadnezzar phu sa khamh milim bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Babylon mite pawlkhat in Jew mite a siat son natu hunpha khat nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa tungah, “Kumpipa awng, nungta tawntung ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tum theite hong kitum pawpo ciang, mihing theampo kunin khamh milim bia tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua milim mai ah a kun ngawl, a bia ngawl peuma meiphual lingh sungah kibum tu hi ci in Nangma Kumpipa in thu na pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babylon ngam khen uk tu a na koi Nangma Kumpipa ii thu a ni ngawl — Shadrach, Meshach le Abednego — Jew mi pawlkhat om hi. Amate in na pathian le bia ngawl, na phu sa milim mai ah le kun ngawl uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia po ciang kumpipa a thin uuk ngawp a, tua mihing thumte a mai ah a kipuak natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa in amate tungah, “Shadrach, Meshach le Abednego awng, keima ii pathian bia nuam ngawl a, ka phu sa khamh milim mai ah kun nuam ngawl hong kici sia a maan ma ahi na'am?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tu in lemlete, oboe te, liamlo te, zither te, tengtonghte le a dang tum thei tuatuam theampo ii aw na zaak po uh ciang kun in tua milim bia vun. Na bia bua uh le, thakhat thu in a lingh meiphual sungah hong kikhia tu hi. No hong hun zo tu pathian khat pawpo om tu in um nu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Shadrach, Meshach le Abednego in, “Kumpipa awng, ko le ko kihuuk natu hanciam ngawl tu khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka biak ka paai uh Pathian in a naseam kote meiphual sung pan le na khut sung panin hong hun thei ahi nale hong hun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahizong hong hun buahial zong Nangma Kumpipa awng, na pathian ka bia tuan buatu uh a, na phu sa khamh milim mai ah ka kun buatu uh hi, cisia hong heaksak ta'n” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in Shadrach, Meshach le Abednego tungah a thin uuk mama a, a mai san liang hi. Tua ahikom ama in meiphual sia a sat ngeina sang a salivei in a satsak zawk natu in a mite thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in a ngalkaphonpi sung pan a thahat belte in hi mihing thum teng heencip in a lingh meiphual sungah khia tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate thum sia a puansilh theampo a cingin — laktongte, puantualte silh sa le lukhu khu sa in heencip uh a, a lingh meiphual sung denna in nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu in, kumpipa in meiphual a sat mama natu in ngat takin thupia ahikom tua mite meikuang sungah a khia a cing teng sia meikuang in kaanghlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciang Shadrach, Meshach le Abednego sia heencip sa in a lingh meikuang laizang ah taaksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tha khat thu in Nebuchadnezzar sia lamdang sa in dingto vat hi. Ama in a uliante tungah, “Mihing thumte heencip in meiphual sungah khia zo hi ka na ngawl hi ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Amate in, “Hi hi, Kumpipa awng,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tua ahile banghangin meikuang sungah mihing li kot vavaa in mu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Amate kiheencip ngawl a, liam zongh liam tuak beak ngawl uh hi — tuaciang a lina pa sia vantunglalang khat taw kibang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaciang Nebuchadnezzar sia meiphualpi kongkha kungah paito a, “Shadrach! Meshach! Abednego! Lianbel Pathian ii naseamte awng, hong pusuak tavun!” ci in sam hi. Tuaciang amate thakhat thu in pusuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpinote, ngamkhen ukte, ngamkhen uk domte le kumpi ulian dangte theampo in mei ii kak ngawl mihing thumte en tu in hong kikhawm uh hi. Amate a sam kaang ngawl, a puante kaang ngawl a, meikhu ngim zongh nam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Shadrach, Meshach le Abednego ii Pathian pok vun! Ama in a vantunglalang sawl a, ama muangin, ama na a seam hi mihingte suatak hi. Amate in ka thupiakte ni ngawlin amate ii Pathian simngawl pathian dang khat pawpo mai ah kunin a biak tu sangin a nuntak nate khaam zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tuaciang tu in minam, minam khen ahibuale paunam khat po sung pan a kuama po in Shadrach, Meshach le Abednego ii Pathian sonsiatna kampau a om le a khut a peang kisemtham tu a, a inn sia niinthuk kisuaksak tu hi, ci in thu ka pia hi. Hi bangin a suatak thei pathian dang om ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciang kumpipa in Shadrach, Meshach le Abednego sia Babylon ngamkhen sungah a za uh khangsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in leitung ah a om ngam theampo, minam theampo le paunam theampo pan mihingte tungah a nuai a bang thu puak hi: “Kong nukset hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lianbel Pathian ii ka tungah hong lak a lamdangte le nalamdang laknate ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Pathian ii eite hong lak nalamdangte lian lawlawm hi! A vawt nalamdang laknate vaang nei lawlawm hi! Pathian sia a tawntungin kumpi hi a; ama in a tawntungin uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Keima in kumpi inn sungah ka teang hiithiat a, nuamsa mama in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang a patau huai mang khat ka man a, ka mut laitakin a lauhuai mu kholnate ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mang khiakna hong son thei tu in, Babylon ngamsung kumpi thudokte theampo ka kungah hong pai natu in thu ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciang aisaan theite, mitbum thiamte, doaiai neite le aksi enthiamte theampo kisam a, amate tungah ka mang ka son hi, ahizong amate in a khiakna hong son thei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang Daniel (a min dang Belteshazzar, ka pathian min a kitap pa) hong tum hi. A thiangtho pathiante ii thaa sia ama sungah om ahikom, ama tungah ka mang ka son hi. Ama tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aisaan theite ukpi Belteshazzar awng, a thiangtho pathiante ii thaa sia na sungah om in thu telhak theampo na tel thei hunlam ka he hi. Hi sia keima mang hi. A khiakna hong son ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka mut laitakin leitung laizang ah thingkung lian mama khat mukholna khat ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua thingkung sia van a phak dongin lian vaial in khangto a, leitung mihing theampo in mu thei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A teete et hoi a, tuaciang a ngate taw tuaisuk in — leitung bup ii a neakkhop tu za in nga thiam hi. Ngamsate in a lim bealhin tawlnga a, vacimte sia a baakte tungah bu tom hi, tuaciang nuntakna nei a minpiang theampo in a nga ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka mukholna thu ka ngaisut laitakin khua a phawk vilvel, a mit pilvang vantunglalang khat sia vantung pan hong tuaksuk ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in nging takin, ‘Tua thingkung phuktan in a, a baak teng siiktan in; a tee teng heu thiang in a, a nga thethaang in. A nuai a nganhing teng le thingbaak tungah vacim teng bengkeak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahizong a bul sia thik le taau kual taw khit in lei sungah nusia in. Tua mun lo sungah lopa taw nusia in. “ ‘Tu in hisia pa tungah daaitui kia tahen a, ama sia nganhingte le thingkungte taw teang khawm tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in kum sali sung mihing ngaisutna nei ngawl tu a, ahizong nganhing ngaisutna nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi thu sia a pilvang le a phawk vilvel vantunglalangte ii thukhenna ahi hi. Tua ahiciang mun theampo ah om mihing theampo in, Lianbel Pathian in mihing kumpi ngamte tungah vaang nei a, ama ii teal khat pawpo — mihing thupi ngawl belte ngawngawn tungah zongh kumpi ngamte pia thei hi ci thu he tahen, ci in thangsak hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ka mangmat sia hi bang hi,” Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in ci hi. “Tu in Belteshazzar awng, a khiakna hong son ta'n. Ka kumpi thudokte kuama in hong son thei ngawl hi, ahizong nang sungah a thiangtho pathiante ii thaa om ahikom nong son thei tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang Belteshazzar zongh a kici Daniel patau mama ahikom bangma pau thei ngawl hi. Kumpipa in ama tungah, “Belteshazzar awng, tua mang le a thu in patausak heak in,” ci hi. Belteshazzar in, “Kumpipa awng, tua mang le a khiakna sia nang tungah hong tung ngawlin na ngalte tungah tung zaw le ka oai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A saang mama van a ban thingkung sia leitung mihing theampo in mu thei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A teete et hoi a, leitung bup a vaak khom zo tu in a nga nga thiam hi. Ngamsate a nuai ah tawlnga in, vacimte a baakte tungah bu tom uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, nangma in a saang, a thahat thingkung sia na hi hi. Khangto in lian mama na hikom vantung na baan to a, na vaangletna sia leitung buppi ah kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpipa Nangma in na et laitakin, vantunglalang khat vantung panin hong tuaksuk a, ama in ‘Thingkung phuk in a, susia in, ahizong lei sungah a bul nusia in. A bul ah thik le taau kual vial in a, tua mun lo sungah lopate taw nusia in. Hisia pa tungah daaitui kia tahen a tua munah kum sali sung nganhingte taw teang tahen,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, a khiakna sia hi bang hi a, nang tungah hong tung tu in Lianbel Pathian ii ci sa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihing huamsung panin hong kihawlkeak tu a, ngamsate taw na teang khawm tu hi. Khuital khat bangin kum sali sung lopa ne in lozau sungah zan na ngiak tu a, na tungah daaitui hong kia tu hi. Tuaciang Lianbel Pathian in mihing kumpi ngamte uk a, tuate sia ama ii teal khat pawpo pia thei hi ci sia na saang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vantunglalang in lei sungah tua thingbul a kinusiat natu in thupia hi. Tu sia in leitung theampo Pathian ii uk ahi hunlam na tel tak ciang kumpi na sua kik tu hong sonna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahiciang kumpipa awng, kong thuhilna hong ni ta'n. Mawna na vawt kheal in a, a maan in seam in, tuaciang a zawngte hesuak in. Tua hile na nuamsa tawto tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi thu theampo Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa tungah tung siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tha sawm le tha nii bek zawkciang, ama ii Babylon kumpi inn khuvum tungah a va kawkoai kawmin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ama in, “En vun, Babylon khua bangzata lian ziam! Ka vaangletna, ka thahatna, ka minthanna le ka letnate lak natu ka khuapi in ka sa hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A kammalte zongh khuangkhim ngawl lai in, vantung pan pauna aw khat hong nging a, “Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa awng, ka thu son ngai in! Na kumpi vaangletna sia tu in na tung pan hong kilaaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nangma sia mihing huamsung pan hong kibeng tu a, ngamsate taw teang khawmin, khuital khat bangin kum sali sung lopa na ne tu hi. Tuaciang, Lianbel Pathian in mihing kumpi ngamte uk a, a teal khat pawpo tungah kumpi ngamte pia thei ahi hunlam na he tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A kammalte thakhat ma taangtung paih hi. Nebuchadnezzar sia mihing huamsung pan kibengkeak a, khuital khat bangin lopa ne hi. A pum tungah daaitui kia in, a sam sia muvanlai thate za in sau a, a khutcinte sia vacimte ii peangcin za in sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Kum sali a cin zawkciang van ka ento a, ka thin hong ciim kik hi. Lianbel Pathian ka pok a, a nungta tawntung pa khat tungah zatakna le minthanna ka pia hi. “Ama in a tawntungin uk tu a, a kumpi ngam sia kip tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in leitung mite bangma in a thusim bua a; vantung a om vantung mite le leitung a om mite ama in uk hi. Ama deina kuama in nalh thei ngawl a, ahibuale a sep a vawtte kuama in dongh kik thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Ka thin a ciim kik ciang ka minphatna, ka kumpi za le ka kumpi ngam ukna vaang hong kipia kik hi. Ka uliante le ka nampi mite in hong muak uh a, nidang sangin a lianzaw minphatna le ka kumpi vaang hong kipia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Tu in keima Nebuchadnezzar in Vantung Kumpipa pok in, zatakna pia in, a min ka thangsak hi. Ama ii a sep a vawt theampo a maan le a thutang hi a, ama in kiphasak a, a ngamta pawpo kiniamkhiaksak thei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zan khat Belshazzar kumpipa in a uliante tulkhat samin anneak poaipi khat vawt a, sapittui nekhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sapittui a neak laitakin a pa Nebuchadnezzar ii Jerusalem Biakinnpi pan a laak khamh hai, ngunn haite le kuangte sungtan pui tu in thupia hi. Kumpipa in ama le a uliante, a zipite le a zinote taw sapittui a neak thei natu in tuate la in a sawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thakhat thu in khamh haite le kuangte kitumpui a, a vekpi in tuate taw sapittui ne in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />khamh, ngunn, taau, thik, thing le suang taw a kivawt pathiante pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thakhat thu in mihing khut khat kilangh a, meiinn mei a taangbelna mun, kumpi inn sung pang tungah lai at hong kipan hi. Kumpipa in lai a at tua khut sia mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa lau mama in, a mai daang a, a khup liing tu kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in mitbum thiamte, bum le aitoaite le aksi enthiamte sam tu in oksan hi. Tua a sapte hong thet ciang, kumpipa in amate tungah, “Hi lai a ki at sia a sim thei, a khiakna hong son thei pawpo kumpi puantual sandup kisilhsak tu a, minphatna khamh khi a ngawng ah awsak in kumpi ngam sungah a zalian a thumna in ka koi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua kumpi thudokte mai ah hong pai uh a, ahihang lai ki at sia a sim thei, a khiakna a son thei kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Belshazzar kumpipa sia a thinngimna taw in a mai daang vaial a, a uliante in a ci a law he ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa ii nu in kumpipa le a uliante ngamlum lialuana aw za a an neakna inndoi sungah tum hi. Ama in, “Kumpipa awng a tawntungin nungta ta in! Nong hesuakna in thinnuam ngawlin maidaangin om heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ngam sungah a thiangtho pathiante ii thaa a nei mihing khat om hi. Na pa kumpi ahi lai in, hi sia pa in, pathiante ii ciimna taw kibangin ciimna, heakna le ngaisut thiamna nei hi. Tuaciang na pa, Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in ama sia aisaan theite, mitbum thiamte, bumtoai aitoaite le aksi enthiamte a ukpi tu in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama sia a tumdang hi theina nei a, ciim in, mang khiak thei pilna, thu kheldoknate zo theina le thutumdangte sontel theina nei hi; tua ahikom kumpipa in Belteshazzar ci a, a min a phua pa Daniel sam in, tua hile ama in hite theampo ii khiakna hong sonthiang siat tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Daniel sia thakhatin kumpipa omna ah kipaipui a, kumpipa in Daniel tungah, “Judah ngam pan ka pa, kumpipa ii hi sungah hong pai pui Judah sal Daniel na hi na'am?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thiangtho pathiante ii thaa sia na sungah om a thiamna, heakna le ciimna na nei hunlam ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi a ki at lai a sim tu le a khiakna hong son tu in thudokte le mitbum thiamte hong kipaipui napi amate in a khiakna he zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma in a khiakna kiphualsealte le thutumdangte sonthiang thei hi, ci in tu in ka za zo hi. Hi lai ki at sia na sim thei a, a khiakna nong son thei le, kumpipa puantual sandup hong kisilhsak tu a, minphatna khamh khi na ngawng ah aw in, kumpi ngam sungah a zanei a thumna na hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Daniel in, “Na letsongte nangma atu keam po in, ahibuale ngualdang khat po pia in. Kumpipa awng, lai ki at sia kong sim tu a, a khiakna kong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Lianbel Pathian in na pa Nebuchadnezzar sia kumpi lian khat in koi a, zatakna le vaangletna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama sia lian mama ahikom ngam theampo, minam theampo le paunam theampo pan mihingte in ama kiita in liing uh hi. Mihing khat pawpo a thatlum nuam le thatlum a, a nungtasak nuam le nungtasak hi. Ama in a upat nop pawpo upat a, a maimawlsak nop pawpo maimawlsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong ama sia kiphasak, thinpui, ngilo ahikom a kumpi tokhum pan kinot a, a minthanna taan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama sia mihing huamsung pan kihawlkeak a, nganhing ngaisutna hong nei hi. Ama sia ngam laate taw teang khawmin, khuital bangin lopa ne a, daaitui dal tu nei ngawlin a pua sangah lum hi. Lianbel Pathian in mihingte ii kumpi ngam theampo uk a, ama ii dei pawpo tungah tua ngamuknate pia thei hi ci sia a khak belin ama in phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ahihang nangma, a tapa in, hi thu theampo he hi napi na kiniamkhiak bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vantung Topa na langpan a, a Biakinn pan na laak haite kuangte nong paipui hi. Nangma, na uliante, na zite le na zinote in tua haite taw zu ne in, khamh, ngunn, taau, thik, thing le suang taw a kivawt khuamu thei ngawl, khua za thei ngawl a, bangma a he ngawl pathiante na pok uh hi. Ahitazong na thi tu le na nun tu hong khensat a, na sep na vawt theampo hong uk Pathian na upat bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua hu in Pathian in hi kammalte at tu in tua khut sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tua a ki at kammal in hi bang ahi hi: ‘MENE, MENE, TEKEL, U-PARSIN.’ ‘Sim, sim, khaitee, kikhen,’ a cina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A khiakna in hi bang ahi hi: Sim ii a khiakna in Pathian in na kumpi ngam ii hunte hong simsak zo a, a hun bo zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khaitee ii a khiakna in nang sia toaitee na tungah hong kitee zo a, zaang leih in hong kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kikhen ii a khiakna in na ngam kikhentham a Mede mite le Persia mite tungah kipia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thakhat ma in Belshazzar in Daniel sia kumpi puantual sandup silhsak tu le minphatna khamh khi a ngawng ah awsak tu in a naseamte thupia hi. Tuaciang ama in Daniel sia a ngam sungah zalian a thumna in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua zan mama in Babylon kumpipa Belshazzar sia kithatlum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tua laitak kum sawmluk le kum nii a pha Mede mi Darius in a kumpi za suan hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darius in a kumpi ngamlian sung theampo uk tu in ngamkhen uk, za le kul panmun piak tu in khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua banah, ukpite a lampui tu le kumpipa deina bang a seam tu in Darius in Daniel le a dang mihing nii teal thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Daniel in ngamkhen uk dangte, ahibuale nasep uk dangte sangin nasep a thiam zawkna sia hai ngawlin lak hi. Ama sia pil mama ahikom kumpipa in a kumpi ngamlian bup a uk tu in koi tu in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang nasep uk dangte le ngamkhen uk tengin Daniel ii kumpi ngamlian uk nasepna encik a, a khialna zon tu hanciam uh hi. Ahihang Daniel sia muanhuai a, a thumaan le a citak khat ahikom amate in a khialna, a thumaan ngawlna mu zo ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate khat le khat kikum uh a, “Daniel sia a biakna taw kisai thu khat po taw, ahibuale mawsak natu thudang ih mu buatu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciang amate kumpipa taw kimu tu in pai uh a, “Darius kumpipa awng, Nangma Kumpipa a tawntungin nungta ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kumpi ngamlian sungah naseam koma teng — nasep ukte, ngamkhen ukte, ngamkhen uk domte le a dang uliante — in kumpipa in ngat tak a zui tu thupiak khat nong suasak tu in thukim zo khu hi. Tu zo ni sawmthum sung teng Nangma Kumpipa tung simngawl, pathian khat pawpo, mihing khat pawpo tungah bangma peuma ngen thei ngawl tu hi, ci in thupia in. Hi thupiakna a paltan peuma tawpi a dim a kikhum dum sungah kikhia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Nangma Kumpipa in hi thupiakna lai minthu in suaksak in. Tua hile tua thupiakna sia a kikheal thei ngawl Mede te le Persia te thukham suak tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in Darius kumpipa in tua thukham tungah a minthu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa thukham sia kumpipa in a minthu zo hi, ci thu Daniel in a heak ciang a inn ah cia hi. A inndawl tung inndoi khat sungah Jerusalem khua sang a maingat khelkite om hi. Tua munah, a vawt ngei tawntung bangma in, khelki kihongna te ah khupdin in ni khat sung thumvei veu Pathian tungah thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Daniel ii a ngalte in Pathian tungah Daniel thunget a mu uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a vekpi in Daniel mawsak tu in kumpipa kungah paikhawm tek hi. Amate in, “Kumpipa awng, tu zo ni sawmthum sung kumpipa tung simngawl, pathian khat pawpo tung, mihing khat pawpo tungah thungen khat a om peuma le tawpi a dim a, a kikhum dum sungah kilawn tu hi ci in thukham sungah na min na thu zo hi,” ci uh hi. Kumpipa in, “Hi hi, tua in a kikheal thei ngawl a ngat thupiakna, Mede te le Persia te thukham khat ahi hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in kumpipa tungah, “Judah salte khat ahi Daniel in Kumpipa Nangma hong zakta ngawl, na suasak thupiakna sia zui ngawl hi. Ama in ni khat sung thumvei peal ngawlin thungen hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa sia hi thu a zaak ciang a thinnuam ngawl het a, Daniel a suatak thei natu lam khat a hi thei tawpin zong nuam hi. Nitum dong hanciamin khuangaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciang Daniel ii ngalte kumpipa kungah pai kik a, ama tungah, “Kumpipa awng, nangma in Mede te le Persia te upadi te bangin kumpipa ii thu piaksa sia kikheal thei ngawl hi ci thu na he hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kumpipa in Daniel sia a mat natu le tawpi a dim a kikhum dum sungah a khiak natu in thupia hi. Kumpipa in Daniel munah, “Citakna taw a na, na sepsak na Pathian in nang hong suatak tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kuama in Daniel a suataksak thei ngawl natu in suangtum khat taw tawpi dum vang khakin, suang tungah kumpipa tazeik le a uliante ii tazeik khen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa a inn ah cia kikin tua zanin mittang khat zongh si ngawl, an zongh ne ngawl, leangna do ngawlin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zingsang khuavak tuungin kumpipa tho in, tawpi khumna dum ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua mun a thet ciang, “A nungta Pathian ii naseam Daniel awng! citakna taw a na, na sepsak na Pathian in tawpite kung pan hong hun thei ziam?” ci in thintoina taw biakpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daniel in, “Kumpipa Nangma, a tawntungin nungta ta in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian in tawpite ii kei hong liamsua ngawl natu tawpite kam a hum tu in a vantunglalang sawl hi. Kumpipa awng ka maw ngawl hunlam le nang tungah kong khial ngawl hunlam Pathian in he a hikom hi bangin vawt hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpipa lungdam leilam a, tawpite khumna dum sung pan Daniel a kikaito natu in thupia hi. Tuabangin Daniel kaito uh a, liamna a nei vet ngawl hunlam mu uh hi, banghang ziam cile ama in Pathian muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa in Daniel a mawsak mihingte theampo mat tu in thupia a, a zite le a tate taw tawpi a dim dum sungah khiasuk hi. Dum taw a thet ma ngawngawn in, tawpi te in amate mat khat sua in a ngu a taang theampo duangleam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Darius kumpipa in ngam theampo, minam theampo le paunam theampo pan mite tungah laithak hi: “Kong nukset hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka kumpi ngamlian sung a om mihingte theampo in Daniel ii Pathian a kiitak natu le a zatak natu in thu ka pia hi. “Ama in a nungta Pathian hi a, a tawntungin uk tu hi. A ngam kisiasak ngeingawl tu a, a vaangletna bo ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in ngum in suatak a; vantung le leitung ah a lamdangte le nalamdang laknate vawt hi. Ama in Daniel sia tawpite thalup natu pan suatak hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Daniel sia Darius ii maan hun sung le Persia mi Cyrus ii maan hun sungin nuamsa hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belshazzar ii Babylon kumpi a sep kipat kumin keima in mang khat ka man a, zanin mukholna khat ka mu hi. Ka mang mat sia lai taw ka at a, tua zan a ka mu sia ka tepteena in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hi bang ahi hi: Mun theampo pan vui hong va a, tuipi mai seam ngawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuipi sung pan nganhing lian li pusuak a, khat le khat kibang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A masabel sia tawpi taw kibang a, ahizong muvanlai khat bangin tha nei hi. Ka et laitakin a thate tong hi. Tua nganhing sia kilaamto in mihing bangin kidingtosak hi. Tuaciang ama sia mihing ngaisutna kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A niina nganhing sia a nung peangte taw a ding vompui khat taw kibang hi. Tuasia in a hate taw telngu thum pu a, awnging khat in ama tungah, “Sa na neak zawk zaza ne tan lai in!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka et laitakin nganhing khat kilangh hi. Tuasia pawlbeam taw kibang a, ahizong a nungzaang ah vacim tha taw a kibang tha li om in lutang li nei hi. Thu nei tuak khat in kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka et lalai le, nganhing a lina kilangh hi. Tuasia vaang nei a lauhuai in kiitakhuai hi. A mat sate sia a thik ha lian taw khimtham in tua zawkciang tuanhcil hi. Nganhing dangte taw kibang ngawlin, kii sawm nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua kiite ka salh laitak a dang kiite sungah kiino khat hong poto ka mu hi. Tua kiino in tua munah a omsa kii thumte phulkeak hi. Hi kii in mihing mittangte le kiphatsak kam a pau kam khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka et laitakin kumpi tokhumte a om natu san tek ah hong kikoi hi. A nungta tawntung mihing khat sia tua kumpi tokhumte khat tungah to hi. A puante vuuk bangin paak a, a sam sia tuumul taw kibang hi. A kuang muite tungah a kinga a kumpi tokhum sia, meikaang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua mun panin meikuang a kipee in hong pusuak hi. Ama ii naseam tu in mihing tul tam mama tua munah om a, ama mai ah mihing awn tam mama ding uh hi. Thukhen natu hun kipan a, laibute kihong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka et laitakin tua kiino ii kiphatsakna kam a papau ka za thei lai hi. Ka et lalai ciang nganhing a lina sia kithatlum a, a luang sia meikuang sungah kivawkin kaanghtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nganhing dangte ahile a vaang kilaaksak a, ahizong a nuntak lai natu hun ciangtan khat kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi mukholna ka mu ni zanin mihing taw a kibang khat ka mu hi. Ama sia meeikaai in kiim uum in ka kung hong neak a, tuaciang a nungta tawntung pa kung zuanin tua pa taw kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngam theampo, minam theampo le paunam theampo pan mite in ama ii na a sep natu in ama sia thu neina, upatna le kumpi vaangletna kipia hi. A thuneina in a tawntungin kip tu a, a kumpi ngam bo ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mukholnate in hong patausak a, ka thin hong nawngkaisak mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua munah a ding mihingte khat kungah ka paito a, hi sia ii khiakna hong son siat natu in ka dongh hi. Tua ahiciang ama in a khiakna hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in, “Hi nganhing lian lite sia leitung ah a piang tu kumpi ngamlian lite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang Lianbel Pathian ii mihingte in kumpi vaangletna nga tu a, a tawntung a tawntungin keam tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a dangte taw a kibang ngawl nganhing lina — a kiitakhuai mama, a mat sate sia a taau peangcin le a thik ha taw khimtham in a tuanhcil sia ii thu a tamzaw ka he nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lu tung a om kii sawmte ii thu le a zawkciang hong poto a, kii thumte a pukvawksak kii sia ii thu ka he nuam hi. Tuasia in mittangte le kam khat nei a, kiphatsak kam pau hi. Tuasia a dangte khat pawpo sangin kiitakhuai zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka et laitakin, tua kii in Pathian ii mihingte do in zothal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang a nungta tawntung mihingpa hong pai a, Lianbel Pathian ii mihingte ngumin thu khen hi. Pathian ii mihingte ii kumpi vaangletna a nga natu hun hong theng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi sia keima tungah hong kison a khiakna ahi hi: “Nganhing lina sia leitung ah a om tu kumpi ngamlian lina hi a, kumpi ngamlian dangte theampo taw kilamdang tu hi. Tuasia in leitung buppi sutham in tuanhcil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kii sawmte sia tua kumpi ngamlian uk tu kumpi sawmte ahi hi. Tua zawkciang kumpi dang khat hong piang tu hi; ama sia a om masate taw kilamdang mama tu a, kumpi thumte lawnthal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in Lianbel Pathian sia sonsia tu a Pathian ii mihingte nengcip tu hi. Ama in amate ii biakna taw kipawl thukhamte le poai vawtnate khealsak tu in hanciam tu hi, Pathian ii mihingte sia ama ii khutnuai ah kum thum le kumlang om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciang vantung thukhenna munah thu kikhen tu a, ama ii vaangletna kilaaksakin, kisusia dipdeap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Leitung kumpi ngam theampo ii vaang le a letna sia Lianbel Pathian ii mihingte tungah kipia tu hi. Amate kumpi vaang sia bo ngeingawl tu a, leitung a ukte theampo in amate na sepsakin a thu ni tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi sia thu tepteena ii tawpna ahi hi. Ka lau mama hu in ka mai daang a, thu theampo keima thinsung bek ah ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belshazzar kumpi a sua zawk a kum thum kumin a nii veina mukholna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka mukholna sungah thakhatin Elam ngamkhen sung a ki uumcip Susa khuapi sungah keima le keima ka kimu hi. Keima sia Ulai ngunhui ah ka ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua ngun pangh ah kiisau nii a nei tuutal khat ka mu hi, a kii khat sia a dang sia sangin sau zaw in thak zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua tuutal in a kiite taw, nitumna sang, saksang le thangsang a sik kawkoai sia ka en hi. Nganhing dangin khaktan zo ngawl a, a thahatna pan suakta zo ngawl uh hi. Ama sia a uk bang po ngamta in kisathei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bang a cinopna ahi tam maw ci in lungmang a ka om laitak, nitumna sang pan keal khat hong tai vingveng a, a tai ngang mama ahikom a peang in lei zongh pha ngawl hi. Tua kealtal in a mitte kilaklaw ah a kician mama kii khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia in ngunhui ah a ding ka mu tuutal zuan a, a tha nei zaza taw manlang tak del hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in tuutal a sik ka en hi. Tuasia a thin uuk mama ahikom, tua tuutal si ngawpin, a kiite nii taltansak hi. Tuutal in a nan zawk natu thangui thatang nei ngawl hi. Tuasia lei denna in kinei a, kituanhcil in, a hun zo tu kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua keal sia kisathei vaial a, ahizong a thahatbel laitakin a kii taltan hi. Tua a kii pona munah a kician mama kii li poto a, tuate in mun tuatuam tek kawk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua kii lite sung khat tung pan kiino khat po a, a vaangletna in thangsang le nisuana sang le Kamciamsa Ngam sangah kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama sia vantung ngalkaphonpi, aksite mama do zawk khom natu in thahat a, pawlkhatte leitung ah lawn suk in tuanhcil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in vantung ngalkaphonpi Ukpa ngawngawn nalh in ama tungah ni sim a kipia biakpiaknate khaamin Biakinnpi melsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua munah ni sim biakpiakna a piak luangin mihingte in mawna khialna vawt uh a, biakna maan sia lei ah vawk uh hi. Tua kii in a sepna theampo ah ma tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang vantunglalang khat in a dang khat ii munah, “Mukholna sungah a kimu hi thute bang tanvei kizom lai tu ziam? A kiihuai mawna khialna in ni sim biakpiaknate bang tanvei theak tu ziam? Vantung ngalkaphonpi le Biakinnpi sia bang tanvei kituanhcil tu ziam?” ci in a dok ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A dang vantunglalang in, “Nitak le zingsang kingawm 2,300 vei ngei tu a, tua hun sung teng ah biakpiakna kivawt ngawl tu hi. Tuasia zawkciang Biakinnpi sia a ngeina bangin kipua pha kik tu hi,” ci in a zona ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mukholna ii a khiakna tel nuam a ka hanciam laitak, tha khat thu in ka mai ah mihing khat hong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ulai ngun ngal pan bia puina aw khat ka za a, “Gabriel awng, ama ii mu sia ii a khiakna ama tungah son in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gabriel hong pai in ka kungah hong ding a, lau mama ka hikom lei ah ka puk hi. Ama in kei tungah, “A thithei mihing awng, a khiakna tel in. Na mukholna sia leitung bo natu thu taw kisai hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama ii thu a son laitak khua phawk ngawlin lei ah ka puk hi. Ahihang ama in hong phong to a hong dingsak kikin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ama in, “Pathian thin uukna hangin hong piang tu thute kong lak hi. Tua mukholna in a tawpna hun a lakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Kii nii a nei tuutal na mu sia Media le Persia kumpi ngamte cinopna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keal sia Greece kumpi ngam cinopna hi a, a mitte kilaklaw ah a po a kician kii sia kumpi masabel cinopna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kii po masabel sia a tal zawkciang a po kii lite sia, tua ngam a kikhenna pan hong piang tu kumpi ngam li a cinopna ahi hi, tua ngam lite sia a masabel kumpi ngam za in thahat ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tua kumpi ngamte a bo kuan ciang seksol mama zo ahikom tuate daan kipia tu hi, tuaciang ama thu bek thu a sa, siatna nguicing a vawt a thinkoai le ngualtheam thei kumpi khat piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama a thahat tu a — ahihang ama ii hantang thahatna hi ngawl tu hi. Ama in a lauhuai siatna piangsak tu a, a sep theampo zo tu hi. Ama in mihing thahatte le Pathian ii mihingte susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama sia thimthel pil ahikom ngual theamna taw in a ma tun tu hi. Ama kiphasak tu a, hil khol ngawlin mihing tam mama susia tu hi. Ama in kumpite sung pan a lianbel Kumpipa ngawngawn nalh tu a, ahihang mihing thahatna zangh ngawlin ama kisusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nitak le zingsang biakpiakna thu taw kisai a, hi mukholna ii khiakna bang nang tung hong kisonsa teng taangtung tu hi. Ahihang hi mukholna thu a taangtun tu hun khuangei lai tu ahikom tu in thuku in koi in,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thin kiam in ni tam ma ka ciina hi. Tua zawkciang thoto in kumpipa hong sawl ka nasep ma ka seam kik hi, ahihang tua mukholna in ka lung hong mangsak a, ka tel zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Xerxes ii tapa, Mede mi Darius in Babylon ngam uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama kumpi sua a kum khat kumin keima in thubu thiangthote ka sim a Topa ii kamsaang Jeremiah tungah a son kum sawmsali sung Jerusalem a lalsa in om tu hi, a ci sia thu ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An ka tang a, khau-ip puan silhin vut sungah to in, Topa Pathian tungah hesuak ngenin nasia tak thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian tungah thungen in ka mite ii mawna khialnate ka pualaak hi. Keima in, “ Topa Pathian awng, nang na lian a kong zakta uh hi. Na thuciamna tungah na thumaan a, nang hong it te le na thupiakna bang a seamte a tawntungin na it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kote khialna ka vawt zo uh a, ngilo in ka maw zo uh hi. Sep tu in nong thupiakte kong nial uh a, a maan nong lakna pan ka pial zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kote kumpite, hong ukte, taanghpupite le ko minam bup tungah na min taw thu a son na naseam kamsaangte ii thu ka ngai bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in a tawntungin a maan na seam a, ahizong ko ka hi uh le koma le koma ka mai ka kimawlsak tawntung uh hi. Judea ngam le Jerusalem khua sungah a teang kote theampo le a nai le a khualana ngam tuatuam ah na thethaang Israel te theampo atu in hi thu sia maan hi, banghang ziam cile amate in nang tungah hong thumaan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kote kumpite, hong ukte le taanghpupite in a maizumhuai in ngamta uh a, Topa nang tungah hong maw zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kote in nang hong langpan zo ka hita uh zongin nang in nong hesuak a, nong maisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Oh Topa kote Pathian awng, na naseam kamsaangte tungtawnin nong piak thukhamte bangin nungta tu a nong sawl sia kong nadon bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mite theampo in na thukhamte paltan in na son thute ngai nuam ngawl uh hi. Nang tungah kong maw uh hi, tua hu in na naseampa Moses ii thukham sungah a ki at haamsiatnate ko tungah nong tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kote tung le kote hong ukte tungah kong vawt tu hi nong ci sa bangma in nong vawt hi. Leitung a om khuapi dang khat po sangin Jerusalem khuapi sia a nasia zaw in daan na pia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses thukham sungah a kison daan theampo nong thuaksak hi. Oh Topa kote Pathian awng, ahihang tu ngawngawn zongin ka mawna ka khialna te kisiik in, ahibuale na thumaan thutak zuina taw nang hong lungdamsak tu in, ka hanciam bua uh hi. Oh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa kote Pathian awng, nangma in kote daan hong pia tu in na kithoai a, nong pia takpi hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in a maan bang na seam tawntung a, koma in nang kong nadon bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Oh “ Topa kote Pathian awng, na mite Egypt ngam pan nong paipuina taw in na vaangletna nong lak a, na vaangletna kiciamtee lai hi. Ka maw zo uh hi; khialna ka vawt zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nidang in kote nong huu zo hi, tua ahikom Jerusalem tungah hong thin uuk nawn heak in. Tua in na khuapi, na mual thiangtho ahi hi. Kote ii mawna khialnate le ka taanghpupite ii tatsiatna hangin ka kiim ka paam ngamte theampo in Jerusalem le na mite hong nomu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Oh Pathian awng, ka thungetna le kong thuumna hong ngai ta'n. A kisia sa na Biakinnpi hong pua kik ta'n; mihing theampo in nangma Pathian na hi hunlam hong heak natu in puua kik in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Oh Pathian awng, ko thuson hong ngai ta'n; ko hong en ta'n a, ka ngim thuakna uh le na min a pu khuapi ii thuaknate hong mu ta'n. Ko ii sepna a maan hang hi ngawlin, nangma ii hesuakna suangin thu kong ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa awng, hong za ta'n. Topa awng, hong maisak ta'n. Topa awng, hong ngai ta'n a, hong seam ta'n! Mihing theampo in Pathian na hi hunlam hong heak natu in haisaang heak in! Hi khuapi le hi mihingte sia nangma aa ahi hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima mawna khialna le Israel ka mite ii mawna khialna pualaak in thu ka ngen tan a, Topa ka Pathian tungah a Biakinnpi thiangtho a ngeina bangin a pua kik natu tatsat ngawlin hesuak ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thu ka nget laitakin, a masa ka mukhol lai a ka mu sa Gabriel sia ka omna munah hong leangsuk hi. Tua hun sia nitak sang biakpiak tu hun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in, “Daniel awng, hi kamsaanna thu na tel thei natu in hong hu tu in kong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian tung hesuak ngen tu na kipat ciang ama in hong zo hi. Ama in nang hong it ahikom a deina thu son tu in kong pai hi. Tu in mukholna kong sonthiang laitak thudon in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mawna le ngamtat siatna pan na mite le na khuapi thiangtho a suataksak natu in Pathian in kum sawmsali ii a salivei hunsung ciangtan zo hi. Mawna kimaisak tu a, tawntung thukhaikim thu om tu hi, tuasia ciang mukholna le kamsaanna taangtung takpi tu a, a Biakinnpi thiangtho sia aapna kinei kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi thu ciamtee in tel in: Jerusalem a kipua kik natu thupiakna a om hun pan kipan Pathian ii teal lampui pa hong thet dong kum sali mun salivei hun ngei tu hi. Jerusalem sia a lampite le a kidalna kulh khote taw kivawt kik tu a, kum sawmluk le kum nii ii a salivei kumte dong kho tu a, ahihang hi hun sia buaina hun hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hun a bo ciang Pathian tealsa lampuipa sia thuak tuak ngawl bulin kithat tu hi. Tua khuapi le Biakinnpi sia ngal sim tu in hong kuan a thahat ngamukpa khat ii ngalkaphonpi in susia tu hi. A tawpna sia tuiliim bangin hong pai tu a, Pathian ii vawtkhol ahi ngal kisimna le suksiatna hong paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ukpa in mihing tam mama taw kum sali atu thukimna kho khat vawt tu hi; hi hun ii khenlang hong cin ciangin ama in sangaw biakpiakna le biakpiaknate bosak tu hi. Kiihuai Lau huai Tophala sia Biakinnpi ii a saang belna munah kikoi tu a, Pathian ii vawtkhol bangin a koi pa a bo mateng in tua munah om top tu hi,” ci in hong son hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />(Cyrus ii Persia kumpilian a sua zawk a kum thum kumin Belteshazzar a kici Daniel tungah thu khat kipualaak hi. Tua thu in thumaan ahihang telhak mama hi. Tua thu sia ama tungah mukholna taw in kisonthiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin keima in, nipi thum sung mau in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nipi thum a cin mateng in keima in anlim ahizong sa ahizong sapittui ahizong ka ne bua a, ka sam zongh ka pot bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua kum a tha masa tha, ni kul le ni li ni in Tigris ngun thahat sia hui ah ka ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka etto le puannealte silh a, khamh ciitak kawngkhau a thua mihing khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pumpi sia suangmanpha khat bangin taang hi. A maitang sia khualeng bangin taang a, a mittangte sia mei kuang bangin a leng hi. A baan le a peangte sia taau kizut thiang bangin tee vakil a, a aw sia mi honpi au bangin nging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua mukholna a mu sia keima bek ka hi hi. Keima taw a omkhawm mihingte in bangma mu ngawl uh a, ahihang amate lau in tai a, buu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua munah keima bek ka taang a, hi a lamdang mukholna sia ka en hi. Ka tha om nawn ngawl a, ka meal kikheal ngawp ahikom, kuama in hong tel ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama ii aw ka zaak ciang khua phawk ngawlin lei ah ka puk a, ka khuplam in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang khut khat in hong len in, ka khut le ka khup taw kikhuangkho in hong phongto a; ka liing vadil lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua vantunglalang in ka tungah, “Daniel awng, Pathian in nang hong it hi. Dingto in a, kong son tu thu pha takin ngai in. Na kungah keima hong thataak zo hi,” hong ci hi. Ama in hi thu a son zawkciang, liing vadil kawm ma in ka dingto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang vantunglalang in, “Daniel awng, lau heak in. Telthiamna na nei natu in nangma mama kiniamkhiak tu in, na khensat ni masabel ni pan kipan Pathian in na thunget nate hong za zo hi. Na thungetna a zo tu in kong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Persia kumpi ngam a cing vantunglalang in ni kul le ni khat sung hong khak hi. Tuasia ciang vantunglalangte ii ukpi khat ahi Michael sia kei hong panpui tu in hong pai hi, banghang ziam cile tua mun Persia ngam sungah keima nguak hong kinusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mai lamsang na mipuite tungah a piang tu thute a telsak tu in hong pai ka hi hi. Hi sia in maisang thu tu mukholna ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in hi bang hong son ciang, pau thei ngawlin lei ka sal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang mihing taw a kibang tua vantunglalang in a khut hong thaak a, ka muk hong thamsak hi. Keima in ama tungah, “Syapa awng, hi mukholna in ka tha hong zawmsak mama a, ka ciliing a thai thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A topa mai ah a ding sila khat taw ka kibang hi. Bangbangin hong paupui thei tu khi ziam? Thangui thatang ka nei bua hi, ka husamh hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in khatvei ma hong len kik lai a, tuasia ciang ka tha hatzaw ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in, “Pathian in nang hong it hi, tua ahikom bangma in na thinngimsak heak in a, lausak heak in,” hong ci hi. Hi teng a ci zawkciang ka tha hatzaw seseam ka sa a, “Topa awng nong son tu po hong son ta'n. Ka ci hong damsak zaw ni hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in, “Banghangin na kungah hong pai khi ziam ci sia na he ziam? Thumaan thutak Laibu sungah a ki at thute a pualaak tu in hong pai ka hi hi. Tu in heak kikin Persia a cing vantunglalang sia ka do tu hi. Tua zawkciang Greece a cing vantunglalang hong kilangh tu hi. Israel a cing vantunglalang Michael simngawl kei hong hu tu kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama in kei hong hu tu le hong dal tu in vaipuak nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hi a, tu a kong son tu thu in thumaan ahi hi,” ci hi. Vantunglalang in, “Kumpi thum in Persia ngam uk lai tu a, tua zomin a dang teng sangin a hau zaw kumpi a lina hong khang tu hi. Ama in a thahatbel laitak le a haubel laitakin Greece kumpi ngam thato tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang ngalhang kumpi khat piang tu hi. Ama in kumpi ngamlianpi khat uk tu a, ama uuk pawpo vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong a tha a hatbel laitakin a kumpi ngamlian kitamhtham tu a, khen li kisua tu hi. Ama ii suan le paal ahi ngawl kumpite in ama taangin uk tu a, ahihang amate in ama ii vaangletna za in vaang nei ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Egypt kumpipa thahat tu hi. Ahizong a ngalkap mang lianbelte khat sia thahat zaw lai tu a, kumpi ngam a zai zaw uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum tam mama zawkciang Egypt kumpipa in Syria kumpipa taw kipawl khopna vawt tu a, a tanu taw kiteangsak tu hi. Ahihang tua kipawl khopna sia kho ngawl tu a, tua tanu, a pasal, a ta le a tonpui naseamte theampo kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawk hai ngawlin Egypt kumpipa tanu ii mealheak khat kumpi suak tu hi. Tua kumpipa in Syria kumpipa ii ngalkaphonpi sim tu a, a kulh sungah tum in zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in amate ii pathian milimte le tua pathiante biak piakna in a ki aap khamh le ngunn taw kivawt nate sia Egypt ngam ah pua kik tu hi. Kum tam ma kilemin a om zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Syria kumpipa in Egypt ngam sim tu a, ahihang ama sia kinungkinsak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Syria kumpipa ii tapate ngalsim tu in kinging tu a, ngalkap tam mama khawm tu hi. Kumpipa tapate sung pan khat in tui liim bangin ngalte ii kulh sim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa in a thin uukna taw, Syria kumpipa sim tu a, a ngalkaphonpi matsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama a ngalzawna le ngalkap tam mama a thalup hu in kiphasak tu a, ahihang ngalzo tan ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Syria kumpipa cia kikin a masa a nei ngalkap phaza sang a tamzaw ngalkap khawm tu hi. A hun cing a sak ciang ama in ngalhiam vanhte taw a kinging phitphet ngalkap tam mama taw kuan kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang mihing tam mama in Egypt kumpipa leedo tu uh hi. Tuaciang a mu sa mukholna khat hu in, Daniel awng, na minam sung pan a maitat mihing ngoltol pawlkhat in leedo tu uh hi, ahizong lel tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom Syria kumpipa in kulh taw a ki uum khuapi khat uumci in la tu hi. Egypt ngalkapte in ngal do suak ngawl tu hi; amate sung pan a hatbel te ngawngawn zongh in thahatna a kicing nei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nalh tu om nawn ngawlin Syria ngalkap pa in a uuk bang pawpo in amate vawt tu hi. Ama in Kamciamsa Ngam sungah ding tu a, tua ngam sia a khutnuai ah koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Syria kumpipa in a ngalkap buppi zanghin ngalsimin kuan tu ngeal hi. Tuasia zawkciang a ngal pa ii kumpi ngam a suksiat natu in ama in a ngalpa taw kipawlna khat vawtin a tanu taw kiteangsak tu hi; ahihang ama ngealna taangtung ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in tuipi hui ah ngamte sim tu a, tam mama zo ngawp tu hi. Ahihang ngamdang lampui khat in ama zo tu a, a kisaktheina teng bosak tu hi; ama in Syria kumpipa ii kisaktheina sia ama tung ma ah tungsak kik nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama ngam kulhte zuan kik tu hi, ahihang ama in ngallel tu a, tuabangin ama bo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Kumpi dang khat in ama nungzui tu a, tua kumpipa in a kumpi ngam hauna khanto natu in phiangshia khonna taw mihingte a nengcip tu in ulian khat thataak tu hi. Tawmvei no sungin tua kumpipa kithatlum tu a, ahizong mihonpi mu na le hi ngal sungah hi ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vantunglalang in sonthiang tawto hi: “Syria kumpipa a suak kik tu sia kumpi tu in a kilawm ngawl mi ngilo khat hi tu hi, ahihang muanmawk khol ngawlin ama hong pai tu a, thimthelna taw kumpi za suan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama a nalh pawpo, Pathian ii Thiampi Lianbel ahi keak zong kinil keakin, kibosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kilemna vawtna taw, ama in minam dangte theam tu a, ama sia minam no khat bek uk hi napi thahat vaial tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in hesak khol ngawlin ngamkhen hau khat sim tu a, a taanghpupite kuama ii vawt ngeingawl nate vawt tu hi. Tua zawkciang ama in ngal sungah a laak vanhte le nate sia a nungzuite hawmsak tu hi. Ama in ngal dalna kulhte sim tu in ngeal tu hi, ahihang ama hun bo pal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ama in Egypt kumpipa sim tu in hang takin ngalkap tam mama khawm tu hi, Egypt kumpipa zongh in amate do kik tu in a thahat ngalkap tam mama taw kinging tu hi. Ahihang Egypt kumpipa sia kitheam tu a, ngalzo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama ii a nai puibel a thudokte in ama siasak tu uh hi. A ngalkapte tam mama kithatlum tu a, kibosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tua kumpite ngeal sabuai khat ah an nekhawm tu uh hi, ahihang a ngaisutnate sia khawm uh a, khat le khat kitheam tu uh hi. A hun theng ngawl lai ahikom a dei bang nga ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Syria kumpipa sia Pathian mite ii biakna suksiat tu khensatna nei in ngal sungah a vanh laakte theampo taw a ngam zuan kik tu hi. Ama a uuk bang po in ngamta tu a, tua zawkciang a ngam ah cia kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang ama in Egypt ngam sim leleau tu a, ahihang hi hun ciang thutuam khat piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rome mite ama nalh tu in, teambaw taw hong pai tu a, tuaciang ama a lau tu hi. “Tuasia ciang ama a thin uukin heak kik tu a, Pathian ii mite biakna susia tu in hanciam tu hi. Ama in tua biakna a taisan sate ii ngaisut piakna bang zui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A ngalkap pawlkhatte in Biakinnpi melsia tu uh hi. Amate in ni sim biakpiaknate tawpsak tu uh a, Kiihuai Lauhuai Tophala khat koi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Theamna taw kumpipa in a biakna uh a nusia sa mihingte ii panpuina nga tu hi, ahihang Pathian nung a zuite in do kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mihingte ii lampui ciimte in amate ii a ciimna midang tam mama hawm tu uh hi. Ahihang hun tawmvei sungah amate pawlkhat ngal sungah kithatlum tu a, ahibuale mei taw kihallum tu hi, tuaciang pawlkhatte sia kisuttol tu a, thong kitaaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuabangin thalupna a thuak laitakin, Pathian mite in huna no khat nga tu uh a, ahizong amate a pawl pui mihing tam mama te sia amate phat tuam natu bekin a pawlpui hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua mihing ciim lampuite pawlkhat kithatlum tu a, ahihang hi sia hu in mihingte kithiansua tu hi. Hi sia Pathian ii ciangtan hun, a tawpna a thet dong kizom suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Syria kumpipa in ama uuk babangin ngamta tu hi. Ama in pathian khat pawpo sangin ka lian zaw a, a Lianbel Pathian sang zongin lian zaw ing, ci in kisathei tu hi. Ama sia Pathian ii daan a piak matengin tubangin kiphasak thei tu hi. Pathian in ama ii ngeal sa bang vateak in vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kumpipa in a taanghpupite ii a biak pathian le numeite ii a it pathian zongh melsia tu hi. A tatakin ama in pathian theampo melsia tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama sia tuate sangin lian zaw kisa tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuate luangin ama in kulhte a cing pathian sia upat zaw tu hi. Ama in a taanghpupite ii a biak ngeingawl pathian khat tungah khamh, ngunn, suang manphate le a dang a manpha letsongte pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama ii kulhte cing tu in, ama in ngamdang pathian khat a bia mihingte zangh tu hi. Ama ukpa in a saangte sia ama in minphatna lian pia tu a, zalian pia hi, tuaciang a tel in leitang pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Syria kumpipa ii hun a bo kuan ciang, Egypt kumpipa in ama sim tu hi, Syria kumpipa in a tha nei theampo taw, siphu ngalleangte, siphute le teambaw tam mama zanghin Egypt kumpipa do kik tu hi. Ama in namthuam tuikhang bangin ngam tam mama sim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in Kamciamsa Ngam ngawngawn simin, mi tul tam mama that tu hi. Ahihang Edom ngam, Moab ngam le Ammon ngam sungah a taanglai sun teng suakta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama in tua ngamte theampo a sim ciang, Egypt ngam ngawngawn kikhoaikhe ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in Egypt ii a phual khamh le ngunn le a dang a neisa manpha teng laaksak tu hi. Ama in Libya le Ethiopia ngam zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, nisuana sang pan le saksang pan hong pai thuthak sia in ama patausak tu hi, tuaciang ama in thin uuk tatakin do tu a, mihing tam mama that tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ama in a kumpi puanbuk liante ngawngawn sia Biakinnpi dinna mual le tuipi kilaklaw ah sa tu hi. Ahihang tua mun ah ama a hu tu om ngawlin thi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puanneal a silh vantunglalang in, “Tua hun laitak na mite a cing, a lian vantunglalang Michael kilangh tu hi. Tua zawkciang minamte hong pianciil pan kipan a om ngeingawl a nasiabel ngim ngana hun theng tu hi. Tua hun a thet ciang Pathian ii laibu sungah a min a ki at, na ngammite theampo kingum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thisate tam mama nungta kik tu uh hi: pawlkhatte sia tawntung nuntakna nga tu uh a, pawlkhatte in tawntung maimawlna thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lampui ciimte sia van ii taanna theampo taw taang tu uh hi. A maan seam tu in mihing tam thu a hilte sia aksi bangin taang tawntung tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in kei tungah, “Daniel awng, tu in leitung bo dong tua laibu khup in a, a tungah tazeik tum in. Tua hun sungin, mihing tam mama in bang thu piang ziam ci thu a heak nopna taw hanciam thawthong tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang keima in ngunvaalbo lang le lang ah a ding mihing nii ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate khat in tuilu sang a khuala zawhiatna ah a ding vantunglalang tungah, “Hi a lamdang thupiangte a bo tu sia bang tanvei ngei tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vantunglalang in a khutte nii van sangah laamto a, Tawntung Pathian min taw a ciliap huai kamciamna khat vawt hi. Ama in, “Kum thum le kum lang hi tu hi. Pathian mite a kivawtsiatna a bo ciang hi thute theampo piang siat zo tu hi,” a ci ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama thu son ka za hi, ahihang a cinopna ka tel bua hi. Tua ahikom, “Tuale, topa awng, tuasia bangbangin bo tu ziam?” ci in ka dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Daniel awng, tu in na pai kul tu hi, banghang ziam cile hi kammalte sia a tawpna hong thet mateng kiseal in, thuku a koi tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing tam mama kithiansua tu hi. Mi seksolte in tel ngawl tu uh a seksol tan tu uh hi; miciimte bekin tel tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ni sim biakpiakna te a kitawpsak hun pan, ahibuale Kiihuai Lauhuaina hun pan kipan ni 1,290 ngei tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni 1,335 bo dong thumaanin a om zote sia mihing lungdamte hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tua ahiciang, Daniel awng nangma, a tawp dongin thumaan in. Tuasia zawkciang na thi tu hi, ahihang a tawpna hun ciang, na minphatna tel saang tu in na tho tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
</usx>
